% references.bib
%
% Only checked references go in this file. Each entry has two comments directly above it:
%
%   % CROSSREF <YYYY-MM-DD>: match, doi <doi>
%   % CHECKED <YYYY-MM-DD> <initials>: <design, n, and what the source actually says>
%
% The CROSSREF line is written by Claude (crossref-check skill): the reference exists and its
% details match. The CHECKED line is written by a person who has read the source.
% An entry without both lines is not ready for the manuscript.
% Suggested references that have not been checked go on the list in todo.md, not here.
% References with no CrossRef match are flagged there for human review.
%
% Example of the format (not a real reference):
%
% % CROSSREF 2026-09-11: match, doi 10.xxxx/xxxxx
% % CHECKED 2026-09-12 ANK: RCT, n=84. Effect at 12 months, NOT 24.
% @article{nielsen2024,
%   author  = {Nielsen, A. and ...},
%   title   = {...},
%   journal = {...},
%   year    = {2024},
%   doi     = {...}
% }
